# Live smoke test (tools/live_smoke.sh, docs/ci.md "Live smoke tests"): items.
# A summoned item reaches the inventory and is still there after a zone-in. Stock PEQ items; any GM character.
zone qeynos2
say #summonitem 13005
wait 2
expect-item 13005
zone qeytoqrg
expect-item 13005
# Leave no rations behind: #nukeitem clears every copy from the GM itself (nothing targeted), the cursor too.
say #nukeitem 13005
wait 2
expect-no-item 13005
